        individually); typical ranges are marked as ranges, not guarantees.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Battery Council International (BCI) — group-size definitions and dimensions.</li>
        <li>Manufacturer and distributor fitment literature (Varta, Bosch, Exide-style fitment guides; Canadian Energy, Impact Battery, RD Batteries group references).</li>
